{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sqKoAjhA0J1795300796.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國總統特朗普表示，將會尋求跟伊朗達成長久協議，確保伊方不會有核武。</p><p></p><p>特朗普周六接受霍士新聞訪問時說，希望跟伊朗達成的協議，有效期不只4年或10年，甚至20年，確保即使下任總統不稱職，也不會讓任何人容許伊朗擁有核武。</p><p></p><p>他又表示，伊朗政權更迭不是他的首要目標，指美國已經兩度推翻伊朗領導層，現在的領導層可能比較理性，但仍然難以跟他們談判，並指伊方經常出爾反爾。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T23:40:18.964945+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T22:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T01:54:41.759420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T23:33:28.787837+00:00","content_hash":"6b87598da12bbb3ec7012d6a23a34d90150457af7978ff1057c95edc0149a8fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T23:40:18.964945+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}